      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RITA PAIGE (7) was in traffic and took a tumble last time at Sandown but was placed in a Grade 5 the start prior. Should be in this for a long way. WANGARATTA GIRL (5) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (28.68) at Bendigo behind Kris Bar Imogen in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form out of her last race has been franked. Expected to be in this for a long way. PAW GREGSON (4) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (30.94) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has ability and can atone. UNIVERSE (8) boasts a solid strike-rate from this box.",
